### Ready-made requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Start the gateway first (npm start), then click "Send Request" above any request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?limit=2

### Filter users by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?role=developer

### Get one user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/2

### Get a user that does not exist (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999

### Invalid user id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/abc

### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Katherine Johnson",
  "email": "katherine@example.com",
  "role": "developer"
}

### Create a user with invalid input (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### Auth profile (mock token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer demo-token

### Auth profile without a token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile

### Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?userId=1&unread=true

### Platform status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/platform/status

### Correlation ID: supply your own X-Request-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
X-Request-ID: demo-request-001

### Simulated upstream failure: unavailable (503)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
X-Simulate-Upstream-Failure: unavailable

### Simulated upstream failure: timeout (504)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
X-Simulate-Upstream-Failure: timeout

### Simulated upstream failure: bad response (502)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer demo-token
X-Simulate-Upstream-Failure: error

### Unknown route (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope
